  "Tiap fokus berdiri di atas data yang sama: transaksi nyata dari outlet pilot — dirancang untuk skala ribuan merchant.": "Every focus stands on the same data: real transactions from pilot outlets — designed to scale to thousands of merchants.",
  "Total estimasi ⚠︎": "Estimated total ⚠︎",
  "Dompet yang menampilkan karbon di tiap belanja.": "A wallet that shows the carbon in every purchase.",
  ". Glyiv menyatukan green receipt + wallet: tiap transaksi punya rincian item dan jejak karbonnya. Rencananya dibangun bersama mitra berlisensi (rezim PJP Bank Indonesia) — kemitraannya belum terjalin; token $GLYIV hanya utilitas.": ". Glyiv unites green receipt + wallet: every transaction carries its item breakdown and its carbon footprint. The plan is to build it with a licensed partner (Bank Indonesia PJP regime) — that partnership is not in place yet; the $GLYIV token is utility-only.",
  "🏦 Mitra berlisensi (roadmap)": "🏦 Licensed partner (roadmap)",
  "berizin dengan KYC/AML. Retail dapat menebus sebagian; korporasi mendanai & menebus — kebijakan kami: hanya mencantumkan kredit dari standar diakui (Verra, Gold Standard) & prioritas ICVCM CCP, selaras registri (SRN-PPI/SRUK/SPE-GRK); semuanya masih peta jalan. Glyiv adalah lapisan data & procurement,": "permissioned rails with KYC/AML. Retail can redeem a fraction; corporates fund & retire — our policy: list only credits from recognized standards (Verra, Gold Standard) & prioritize ICVCM CCP, aligned with the registries (SRN-PPI/SRUK/SPE-GRK); all of it still roadmap. Glyiv is the data & procurement layer,",
  "Pantau pertumbuhannya. Laporkan angkanya apa adanya.": "Track how they grow. Report the numbers as they are.",
  "⚠︎ Estimasi industri (green economy & carbon market outlook). Ditampilkan sebagai skala peluang, bukan proyeksi Glyiv.": "⚠︎ Industry estimates (green economy & carbon-market outlook). Shown as opportunity scale, not Glyiv projections.",
