  "Antri di titik bayar membunuh momen —": "Queueing at the pay point kills the moment —",
  "Survei UX kami menegaskan dua hal: pelanggan malas antri, dan setiap struk kertas membuang data paling berharga di outlet — apa yang benar-benar dibeli.": "Our UX survey confirmed two things: customers will not queue, and every paper receipt throws away the most valuable data in the outlet — what was actually bought.",
