  "Scan kode di meja, langsung pesan dari kursimu — tak perlu turun dari lantai 2 atau ikut antrian di titik bayar. Pesanan masuk ke dapur seketika.": "Scan the code on the table and order straight from your seat — no coming down from floor 2, no queue at the pay point. The order reaches the kitchen instantly.",
