  ". Glyiv menyatukan green receipt + wallet: tiap transaksi punya rincian item dan jejak karbonnya. Rencananya dibangun bersama mitra berlisensi di rezim PJP Bank Indonesia; token $GLYIV hanya utilitas.": ". Glyiv unites green receipt + wallet: every transaction carries its item breakdown and its carbon footprint. The plan is to build it with a licensed partner under the Bank Indonesia PJP regime; the $GLYIV token is utility-only.",
