  "Pratinjau produk: sebagian angka bersifat ilustrasi. Item bertanda ⚠︎ adalah acuan yang perlu diverifikasi ulang sebelum dipakai untuk keputusan eksternal.": "Product preview: some figures are illustrative. Items marked ⚠︎ are references that need re-verification before they are used for external decisions.",
  "Platform ekonomi hijau dengan fondasi intelijen karbon. Aset, marketplace, wallet, IoT, dan lainnya — tumbuh bertahap.": "A green economy platform built on a foundation of carbon intelligence. Assets, marketplace, wallet, IoT, and more — growing step by step.",
  "Platform Intelijen & Offset Karbon. Lacak, hitung, dan offset emisi — dari lini operasi hingga neraca korporasi.": "Carbon Intelligence & Offset Platform. Track, calculate, and offset emissions — from the operating line to the corporate balance sheet.",
  "Standards-aligned · metodologi transparan · sertifikasi dalam roadmap": "Standards-aligned · transparent methodology · certification on the roadmap",
  "Kenapa ini penting": "Why this matters",
  "Metodologi: activity-based process-LCA (aktivitas × faktor emisi) selaras GHG Protocol & ISO 14064; faktor dari ecoinvent, DEFRA/DESNZ, IEA, worldsteel, GCCA, EXIOBASE, IPCC. Faktor global/rata-rata — verifikasi spesifik-lokasi diperlukan sebelum pelaporan resmi. Sertifikasi dalam roadmap.": "Methodology: activity-based process-LCA (activity × emission factor) aligned with the GHG Protocol & ISO 14064; factors from ecoinvent, DEFRA/DESNZ, IEA, worldsteel, GCCA, EXIOBASE, IPCC. Global/average factors — site-specific verification is required before official reporting. Certification on the roadmap.",
  "Ubah angka aktivitas untuk melihat estimasi jejak karbon dihitung real-time (faktor emisi bersumber, klik ⓘ), lalu rekomendasi Agen AI & skenario offset. Angka ilustrasi & contoh —": "Change the activity figures to see the carbon footprint estimate computed in real time (sourced emission factors, click ⓘ), then AI Agent recommendations & offset scenarios. Illustrative and example figures —",
