  "Masuk sekali, lalu pilih cabang & ajukan aksesnya dari dasbor — mis. minta uji coba Glyiv Outlet.": "Sign in once, then choose a branch & request its access from the dashboard — e.g. request a Glyiv Outlet trial.",
